Output docs/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1100
Set Height 620
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set WindowBar Colorful
Hide
Type "export PS1='$ ' && alias botsmell='node dist/cli.js' && clear"
Enter
Show
Type `botsmell "Great question! I'd be happy to help — we leveraged a robust fix. Let me know if you have any questions."`
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 4500ms
Type `botsmell "Pushed the fix, the totals match now. Can you test the export?"`
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
